From 4949612154416d0b1c89b95d21254637d441d831 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Langley <davidl@element.io>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:55:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] Use a single uniffi_core for the JavaScript bindings
 runtime

uniffi-bindgen-react-native's runtime crate depends on uniffi_core from
crates.io (=0.31), while this workspace and ruma use a git revision of
uniffi. Point crates.io's uniffi_core at that same revision so that only
one copy ends up in the wasm build. Also re-lock tantivy to the patched
checkout.
---
 Cargo.lock | 40 +++++++++++++---------------------------
 Cargo.toml |  4 ++++
 2 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 8b82310ea..455c866e3 100644
